    <h3 itemprop="name">Can I keep the Harry Potter EPUBs if I cancel Kobo Plus?</h3>
    <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>No. Books borrowed through Kobo Plus (including Harry Potter) are subscription rentals. When your subscription ends, the books are automatically removed from your Kobo library. If you want permanent access, purchase the ebooks individually from the Kobo store. Purchased ebooks remain yours regardless of subscription status.</p>
