      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>The Kobo Plus versions are the standard, unabridged editions as originally published by Bloomsbury (UK) and Scholastic (US). They include the original cover art and chapter decorations. The text is the final authorized edition — the same content you would find in any current print or ebook version.</p>
