        <p>No. You can read Kobo Plus books — including Harry Potter — on any device that supports the Kobo app or Kobo web reader. The Kobo app is available for iPhone, iPad, Android, and Windows/macOS. Your reading position syncs across all devices through your Kobo account. You do not need to own a dedicated e-reader to access the subscription catalogue.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
