    <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Both narrations are available, depending on your region. Kobo Plus subscribers in the UK, Australia, and most Commonwealth countries get the Stephen Fry narration. Subscribers in the United States and Canada get the Jim Dale narration. You can switch between reading the EPUB and listening to the audiobook if you are on the Read & Listen tier ($12.99/month), and your position syncs between both formats.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

